  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TRANSFORM - Inception phase</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sustainable Food Systems for Rural Agriculture Transformation and Resilience (TRANSFORM) &#x2013; Inception Phase 
Overall Objective: To strengthen local food systems in selected Extension Planning Areas (EPAs) of five of Malawi&apos;s districts and to demonstrate a sustainable improvement of food and nutrition security, resilience to climate change and income among agriculture-dependent rural households.</narrative>
  </description>
